{
  "id": "ACT.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Imilimo 28",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo twapuswike, twafikile ku mulundu, elyo twaishiba ukuti cishi ca Molta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba pali ici cishi batupokelelafye bwino bwino. Awe imfula yatampa ukuloka, kwaba ne mpepo. Elyo batukosesha umulilo twalaonta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Paulo aya kumbilisha inkuni, akaka ne cifinga. Ashibika na pa mulilo. Cilya insoka yabusungu yaumfwa icikabilila yafuma mu nkuni, yasuma na Paulo ku cisansa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo abantu ba muli ici cishi bamona uko icisoka cilepelela ku cisansa cakwa Paulo, balaebana abati, “Uyu muntu cine cine cipondo. Nangu apusuka ku menshi nomba Lesa talefwaya ukuti ekale umumi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Paulo akuntila icisoka mu mulilo, ukwabula ukumfwa ubukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena balasubila ukuti alafimba nangu ukuti awe panshi afwe no kufwa. Nomba cilya bamona ukuti papita inshita iyikalamba ne cakumucitikila nakalya, lyena bayaluka balatontonkanya no kusosa abati, “Uyu muntu, mulungu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi mupepi napo twali, kwali amabala yakwa Publio, umukalamba uwaleyangalila ici cishi. Awe atupokelelafye bwino. Kabili pa nshiku shitatu atusungafye bwino bwino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wishi wakwa Publio wena ninshi alelefye, ico alwele impepo no kupolomya umulopa. Elyo Paulo aingilamo kukumupempula. Awe amupepelela, amutambalikapo amaboko, amuposha no kumuposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Paulo aposha uyu muntu, abantu abalwele muli ici cishi balaisa kuli Paulo, nao alabaposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nabo batukwatila umucinshi nganshi, nelyo twaleima no bwato, awe batulongelesha fyonse ifyo twalekabila pa bulendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma yakupwa imyeshi itatu mu Molta, elyo twaima no bwato ubwaikele mu cabu ca Molta mu nshita yampepo. Ubu bwato bwafumine ku Alekisandilia ubo baleti, “Bampundu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bampundu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pali ubu bwato palengelwe utulubi twa milungu ya Bagiriki ibili, bampundu, Kasito na Poluksi, utwana twa milungu Sinsi na Leda. Iyi milungu baleti, eipokololako bacoba ba mato pali bemba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya twafika ku musumba wa Silakusi, awe twalindako inshiku shitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukufuma ku Silakusi twaya fika ku Legimu. Ubushiku ubwakonkapo umwela walapuupa ukufuma ku kapinda ka ku kulyo. Awe mu nshiku shibili twafika na ku Puteoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Puteoli twasangamo ababwananyina, nabo batulomba ukuti twikale nabo umulungu umo. Elyo kabili twaima twaya fika na ku Roma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababwananyina ba mu Roma cilya baumfwa ukuti tuli mu nshila tuleisa, batukonkela baisa fika na ku cisankano ca Apiya na pa Mayanda ya Beni Yatatu. Paulo cilya abamona, ici camuletela icikoseleshi, alatasha na Lesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo twafikile mu Roma, Paulo bamusuminishe ukuti aleikalila eka umwine, ne cita cimo icakumulonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili cilya papita inshiku shitatu, Paulo alonganya intungulushi sha Bayuda. Alabeba ati, “Bamunyinane! Ine nshacitapo nelyo cimo icabipa ku mushobo wesu, nangu ukusuula intambi sha fikolwe fyesu. Lelo mu Yerusalemu balinjikete no kumposa mu minwe ya bena Roma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo batile ilyo bandubulwisha, basanga ukuti nshikwete mulandu uwakunjipailapo. Balafwaya no kundekamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ico Abayuda bakosapo pa mulandu wandi, awe na ine epakutila, kanshi umulandu wandi uli nokuyafye kuli kateeka mukalamba Kesalo. Lelo ine nshakwete mulandu na bantu ba mushobo wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico kanshi nombele ukumonana na imwe no kulanda na imwe. Pantu ndi mu minyololo pa mulandu wa cilayo Lesa alaya abena Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bamwasuka abati, “Ifwe tatwapokapo kalata ukufuma ku Yudeya pa mulandu obe. Elyo tapaba nelyo umo pali bamunyinefwe uwafuma ku Yudeya no kwisa tushimikila nangu ukulanda icibi nelyo cimo pali iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo kwena tulefwaya ukumfwa ifyo iwe uletontonkanyapo. Ifwe twalishiba ukuti mpangafye yonse abantu baletila iyi mpuka wabamo tayaba bwino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baumfwana na Paulo ubushiku bwakulongana. Pali ubu bushiku, lyena baisa longana umwaleikala Paulo, bafulilako nganshi. Alabalondolwela pa mulandu wa Bufumu bwakwa Lesa ukufumafye ulucelo mpaka na ku cungulo. Aesha nganshi ukuti beshibe bwino Yesu mu Mafunde yakwa Mose na mu fyalemba bakasesema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamo bena basuminisha ifyo Paulo alesosa, lelo bambi bena tabasumine iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe basalangana ukwabula ukusuminishanya, elyo Paulo asosa aya mashiwi ayakutila, “Cine cine Mupashi Wamushilo alilungike ilyo alandile kuli kasesema Esaya ukweba ifikolwe fyesu ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa myaka ibili ituntulu Paulo aleikala mu ŋanda alesonkela. Alesekelelafye bonse abaleisa kukumupempula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
